+- **WHEN** a cart or order contains a product associated with a deleted category
+- **THEN** the cart and order remain readable and the cart can still be changed and checked out without category data being required
+
+### Requirement: Category deletion removes the complete subtree
+The system SHALL delete the requested category and every descendant category, while retaining products associated with any of them.
+
+#### Scenario: Descendant categories are deleted
+- **WHEN** a category with nested child categories is deleted
+- **THEN** the parent and all descendants are absent from category listings and cannot be retrieved by id
+
+#### Scenario: Deleted category product listing is empty
